{"availability":"available","full":"Melnus/My-Number-Wallet-Mock","name":"My-Number-Wallet-Mock","description":"マイナポータルのウォレット版で、モック。","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-22T02:09:10Z","updated":"2026-08-22T03:16:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://melnus.github.io/My-Number-Wallet-Mock/","topics":["demo","govtech","mynumber","mynumber-card"],"demo":"https://melnus.github.io/My-Number-Wallet-Mock/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.334Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.334Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.334Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:01:07.334Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This project is a Proof of Concept (PoC) and user interface mockup for a digital identity wallet. It is designed to demonstrate the mechanism of \"Selective Disclosure.\"","Through this application, users can experience how specific information (claims) can be extracted from multiple digital credentials (Verifiable Credentials) and generated into a Verifiable Presentation (VP) tailored to a verifier's specific requirements, rather than presenting the entirety of the original credentials."],"features":["Credential Management: Displays fictional dummy data for various credentials, including identity, tax records, health insurance, and pension information, formatted as digital cards.","Selective Disclosure Simulation: Simulates the following presentation scenarios to demonstrate privacy preservation:","Verifiable Presentation (VP) Preview: Allows users to preview the exact JSON data format that would be transmitted to a verifier during a disclosure event.","Audit Logging: Records a history of when, to whom, and what information was presented. This data is stored entirely client-side utilizing the browser's Local Storage."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Melnus/My-Number-Wallet-Mock/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":